<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICA raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston analyst Rafael Elias-Linero on Wednesday raised his rating for Mexican construction company Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We expect the number, size and diversity of works for ICA to increase significantly in the next few years as a healthier Mexican economy is gradually allowing for increased government spending,&quot; he wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- &quot;In addition, increasing deregulation, privatization and private investment in sectors such as energy and petrochemicals, are expected to greatly enhance ICA's business opportunities.&quot;</p>
<p>-- American Depositary Receipts in the company closed at 16 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
